---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { AUTHOR_NAME, CONTACT_EMAIL, LAST_UPDATED, LEGAL, SITE_NAMES, SITE_URL } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title={`Legal notice – ${SITE_NAMES[lang]}`} description="Publisher, publication director, host, intellectual property, reuse of RTE and CRE data, limits of liability and governing law for this site on the French Tempo colour." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Legal notice' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Legal notice</h1>
    <p>Information published under article 6 III-1 of French law no. 2004-575 of 21 June 2004 on confidence in the digital economy (LCEN).</p>
    <h2>Publisher</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <p>Publication director: {AUTHOR_NAME}, responsible for the content published on {SITE_URL}.</p>
    <h2>Host</h2>
    <LegalIdentity mode="hosting" lang={lang} />
    <h2>Purpose of the site and no advice</h2>
    <p>The site shows, free of charge, the Tempo colour published by RTE and estimates of electricity costs on the regulated tariff, worked out from the visitor’s inputs. These results are not a bill, an offer or personal advice. The site is independent: it has no affiliation with EDF, RTE, Enedis, the CRE or any supplier, and uses none of their logos. Only the colour published by RTE on its own site is binding. Method and limits: <a href={route('method', lang)}>calculation method</a>.</p>
    <h2>Reused data</h2>
    <p>Tempo colours and national demand: data published by RTE (Tempo calendar, éCO2mix on the ODRÉ platform), reused with the source stated. Tariffs: the official blue tariff grid and deliberations of the Energy Regulatory Commission. Public texts are reused under the <a href="https://www.etalab.gouv.fr/licence-ouverte-open-licence" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Etalab Open Licence</a> where it applies.</p>
    <h2>Limits of liability</h2>
    <p>Data is read automatically and checked, with no guarantee of being error-free or always available. The publisher cannot be held liable for a decision taken solely on the basis of an estimate or a colour shown here. Errors can be reported through the <a href={route('contact', lang)}>contact</a> page.</p>
    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>Text, graphics and code are protected and remain the publisher’s property; short quotations are allowed with a link to the original page.</p>
    <h2>Embedding the tool</h2><p>The comparison tool can be embedded free as an iframe, keeping the visible link: see the <a href={route('widget', lang)}>embed page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Personal data</h2><p>Inputs never leave your browser and no cookie is set. See the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a> and the <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies</a> page.</p>
    <h2>Reporting</h2><p>Unlawful content: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>, with the page address and the reason.</p>
    <h2>Governing law</h2><p>French law. Failing an amicable settlement, the competent courts of {LEGAL.jurisdiction}. Updated: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
